
### Get All Turfs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/turfs/
Accept: application/json


### Add Turf 1
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/turfs/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "turf_name": "Green Arena",
    "location": "Thiruvalla",
    "surface_type": "Artificial Grass",
    "price_per_hour": 1200,
    "available": true
}


### Add Turf 2
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/turfs/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "turf_name": "Sports Hub",
    "location": "Changanassery",
    "surface_type": "Natural Grass",
    "price_per_hour": 1500,
    "available": true
}


