### Get Turf by ID
GEThttp://127.0.0.1:8000/turfs/1/
Accept: application/json


### Update Turf by ID
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/turfs/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "turf_name": "Green Arena Premium",
    "location": "Thiruvalla",
    "surface_type": "Artificial Grass",
    "price_per_hour": 1400,
    "available": true
}


### Delete Turf by ID
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/turfs/3/
Content-Type: application/json


### Get All Bookings
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/bookings/
Accept: application/json


### Add Booking 1
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/bookings/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_name": "Aswin Gopinath",
    "phone": "9876543210",
    "turf_id": 1,
    "booking_date": "2026-11-05",
    "start_time": "18:00:00",
    "duration_hours": 2
}


